\pard\sl-240\slmult1 \cf1\lang1033\fs28\f0 The Twilight\fs24 \par
\cf2 You stare at the ominous mansion suspended in midair above the dark chasm, defying all laws of gravity.  A thick swirl of clouds rise from the forbidding void below, where only nothingness exists.  All around an overwhelming darkness chokes out all but a twilight radiating above the distant horizon.\par
\par
What a strange dream, you think. However, after awhile, you begin to realize it is no dream, and is in fact real.\par
\par
Breathing deeply, you  take in a lung-full of the chilling air, trying to remember how you came to be here.  But your mind seems as empty as the space before you.\par
\par
All you can do now is wander around trying to find some answers for what is going on, or at least recover some of the memories that are eluding you.\par
\cf1 \par
